+# arXiv submission package
+
+Title: From Exact Causal Binding to a Falsifiable Planck-Tick Gap Law
+
+Author: Ingolf Lohmann
+
+Suggested primary category: quant-ph
+
+Possible cross-list: gr-qc, subject to arXiv moderator classification.
+
+Canonical source: `docs/research/2026-09-03-planck-tick-gap-law/QIKVRT_Planck_Tick_Gap_Law_2026-09-03.tex`
+
+Machine-readable physical contract: `physics/planck_tick_gap_law_v1.json`
+
+Status boundary:
+
+- `PHYSICAL_HYPOTHESIS_BOUND=true`
+- `DIFFERENTIATING_PREDICTION_FROZEN=true`
+- `EMPIRICAL_CORRESPONDENCE=false`
+- `INDEPENDENT_REPRODUCTION=false`
+- `PASS=false`
+- `FINAL_PASS=false`
+- `EFFECT_ACK_DONE=false`
+
+The manuscript explicitly acknowledges earlier Caldirola / chronon / finite-difference quantum mechanics and makes no priority claim for discretizing the Schroedinger equation. The frozen v1 conjunction is universal Planck-time tick, ground-referenced Hamiltonian, symmetric low-energy branch, parameter-free arcsin gap law, and explicit falsifier.
