+# arXiv submission checklist - Planck-tick gap law v1
+
+External authority boundary: authenticated arXiv submitter account and arXiv moderation.
+
+Repository-complete inputs:
+
+- title: `From Exact Causal Binding to a Falsifiable Planck-Tick Gap Law`
+- author: `Ingolf Lohmann`
+- suggested primary category: `quant-ph`
+- candidate cross-list: `gr-qc` only if accepted by arXiv classification/moderation
+- LaTeX source: `docs/research/2026-09-03-planck-tick-gap-law/QIKVRT_Planck_Tick_Gap_Law_2026-09-03.tex`
+- machine-readable hypothesis: `physics/planck_tick_gap_law_v1.json`
+- repository carrier: PR `#962`
+- Zenodo relation: successor to QIK-VRT formal corpus; prior public anchor `10.5281/zenodo.21488116`
+
+Before external submission:
+
+1. Use the exact promoted-main source, not predecessor-head bytes.
+2. Compile the LaTeX source and compare title/equations/status boundary to the repository contract.
+3. Upload source (and only required source/figure files) through the authenticated arXiv submission interface.
+4. Preserve the arXiv submission identifier before interpreting the transport as publication.
+5. After arXiv announces the paper, read back the public arXiv identifier/version and persist it in the repository.
+
+Do not claim empirical confirmation, independent reproduction, PASS, FINAL_PASS, or general EFFECT_ACK_DONE.
